{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかです‼\nそういや、かなブログに私の写真が載ってた‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにしてねん\nて感じの写真でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みちのく合衆国\nめざましライブ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事終了しましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悪天候の中、\n沢山の方が来てくださいました‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しかったー><"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨なんて気にならなかったぜ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼に口笛を  初披露。\nミニ握手会でまいまい、らりん、ゆきな、ひめか\nの4人はライブに出演しなかったので、\n今回はアンダー13人で頑張りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、いかがだったでしょうか⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事でLessonでの反省。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イメージにとらわれ過ぎてた\nただかっこ良く踊ればいい\n歌詞の意味をちゃんと理解してない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この反省点を生かして\nやっとこのめざましライブで\n披露することができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完璧にできたって訳じゃないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく気持ちよかった。‼‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のライブでも反省しなきゃいけない点は\n沢山見つかりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ、足りないことがいっぱいあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のライブではもっと良い、\n最高のパフォーマンスで\nみなさんに気持ちを伝えたいです。\n笑顔になってほしい。\n元気になってほしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"被災地の人々に届いたかな⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のライブ、沢山の声援で\nなんとか踊り終えることができました‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひかないようにしてください><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼に口笛をの歌詞もダンスもだいすき‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントで狼に口笛をPVの感想\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ある日1人の女の子から\n学校中のみんなにどんどん\nウイルスに感染していくという\nはちゃめちゃなお話。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"噛まれるとパンクスという\nゾンビになってしまうのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンクスになったメンバー、\nひたすら逃げる伊藤ちゃんずに\n注目してください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌って踊ってる時の衣装も\n今までとは全く違ったロックな衣装です‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーそれぞれ違う衣装です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ見ていない方はType-Cを見てね:D\nダンスバージョンもYouTubeで見てね‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん、今日の落書きいい感じや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんでストリーミングラジオ聴いてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼みさとちまと私だよ／\nうはははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑編み込みーーーーーー\nクールだぜーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、明日も元気に頑張りまりか‼\n勉強、部活、お仕事\n頑張りまりかです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がうっっっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでクイズです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え、なんでこのタイミングで...？\nてなった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...\nだだん‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pv「デート前日の気持ち」\n♪「まりっか」には\nメンバーの名前がさりげなく入ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは誰でしょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー、まりっか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で終わらせないでね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0018.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかfamも乃木famみんな\n♪まりっか\nで頭の中うめ尽くしてやる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/4855683/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うりゃっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}